# Files Claude Code should not read into context.
#
# Everything here is GENERATED, VENDORED or a local artifact — never authored
# source. Nothing in this file is a secret; it is purely a context-budget
# guard. The repo's largest generated trees are .next (550 MB), dist (1.2 GB)
# and node_modules (1.2 GB); one stray read of a bundle costs more context
# than the entire authored codebase.
#
# NOT ignored on purpose:
#   tests/fixtures/statements/**      real bank statements + their extracted
#                                     text-layer snapshots. Generated, but they
#                                     are the ground truth a parser is verified
#                                     against (see ARCHITECTURE §4.1a) and they
#                                     are small (< 1 MB each).
#   build/icon.ico, build/icon.png    drawn by scripts/make-icon.mjs but
#                                     committed as electron-builder source.
#   .claude/                          the harness's own config.

# --- dependencies ---------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/

# --- build / packaging output ---------------------------------------------
.next/
out/
dist/
build/
coverage/

# --- vendored third-party binaries (8 MB of wasm + OCR training data) ------
public/vendor/
eng.traineddata
*.wasm
*.traineddata

# --- lockfiles ------------------------------------------------------------
*.lock
package-lock.json

# --- logs and local debug artifacts ---------------------------------------
*.log
cdp6-electron.log
dev-server.log
tests-output.log
opay-test-output.log
devlog.txt
startlog.txt
opay-diag.txt
temp-test-out.txt
tmp_probe.mjs

# --- generated TypeScript / tooling state ---------------------------------
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# --- environment and OS noise ---------------------------------------------
.env*
*.pem
.DS_Store
.vercel/
